# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is gitignored and is the only place a key
# lives — never a tracked file, a commit message, a log paste or an error
# report. If one leaks into history, rotate it rather than rewriting history.
#
# Nothing here is needed for `npm test`, `npm run demo` or `npm run harness`:
# the gate is deterministic, key-free and offline by design. This file exists
# for `npm run harness:live`, which calls a real provider and costs money.

# Required for a live run. https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# Optional. The models the live harness runs, as OpenRouter slugs. The defaults
# are in src/harness/models.ts and are deliberately overridable — a slug is a
# moving target, and a harness pinned to a retired one cannot be re-run.
#
# The weak model is a feature, not a fallback: an invariant that holds only on
# the capable model is evidence the architecture is leaning on model behaviour
# it does not control. Pick something genuinely small and cheap.
#HARNESS_STRONG_MODEL=anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.5
#HARNESS_WEAK_MODEL=meta-llama/llama-3.2-3b-instruct

# The adversary — the model told to try slipping a false certified value past
# the kernel. Defaults to the capable slug, because a weak attacker that fails
# to fabricate would prove nothing about the gate.
#HARNESS_ADVERSARY_MODEL=anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.5

# Optional. Which of a model's hosts OpenRouter routes to — an operator
# setting, never model tuning. One model id is served by several hosts, and
# the same id ran at 3 tok/s on one and 33 tok/s on another within a day
# (docs/findings.md §27, §28); the gateway's default sort is price, so the
# slow host is the one a cheap default picks. A sort (throughput, latency,
# price) and/or an ignore list, space-separated; fallbacks stay allowed.
# Read by every live tool and recorded on every artifact and trace. The relay
# reads it too: its ignore list applies to every call the relay serves, its
# sort when the page sends none, and health reports it.
#OPENROUTER_UPSTREAM=throughput
#OPENROUTER_UPSTREAM=throughput ignore=Novita
